! mcp_bootstrap_p295.strap -- MCP printed page 295: THE SYSTEM COMMAND
! PACKAGE -- its tentacle (J TENT .. J SIZE, YXCOMD) and the OPERATOR
! CONSOLE FIXUP (JCFIX .. SIC,S PRIM R); lines 1-56.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.46, read at 400 dpi, doubtful glyphs
! at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP  CARD
! ID QH000001  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 295" (round glyphs in
! numeric fields read 0).  The heading row's LOCATION field is BLANK:
! line 1 is an asterisk banner (transcription_workflow.md step 1).
!
! THE PAGE.  56 lines, every line number prints a "*" after it; "*"
! after the LOCATION on lines 4, 19, 35 and 55.  A NEW CARD-ID SERIES
! (QH000001): this is the first page of a separately assembled deck.
!   lines  1-3   banner "THE SYSTEM COMMAND PACKAGE"; line 5 banner
!                "COMMAND PACKAGE TENTACLE".
!   line   4     SLC,$ printed at 232714.40 * -- the counter arriving.
!   line   6     CNOP at 232714.40, prints 000000.30 00 (a half-word NOP).
!   lines  7-19  the tentacle's packed parameter word at 232715.00:
!                J TENT DD(BU,4),5 (prints 05), seven DD(BU,1),0, three
!                DD(BU,2) (prints 2, 2, 3), DRZ(BU,2),(14) prints its size
!                000000.34 (28 bits) and gets no !CHECK.  Line 16 is the
!                remark continuation "-CODE .11" (no location).
!   lines 20-21  EXT(0,18) over B,YXCOMD: prints 0465644 at 232715.55 =
!                the 19-bit half-word address of YXCOMD (232722.00).
!   lines 22-29  VF,0 x3 (J RETA on 23), ,0 x5 (J CODE, J FRST, J SIZE).
!   lines 30-31  YXCOMD LX,1,Y XW CMD / B,Y MP FCH.
!   lines 32-34  remark banner "OPERATOR CONSOLE FIXUP".
!   lines 35-56  JCFIX DRZ(N),(2) (prints its size 000002.00, no !CHECK),
!                then code through SIC,S PRIM R at 232740.40.
! Located rows are contiguous from 232714.40 to 232740.40 (a half word;
! next location 232741.00).
!
! JOIN.  p.294 has no scratch deck: contiguity with it is NOT
! established here (line 4's SLC,$ prints 232714.40, the arriving
! counter).  The p.296 scratch deck opens at 232741.00 with serial
! QH000052 -- contiguous with this page's end (232740.40 half word,
! serial QH000051).
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * octal fields "CCCCCC.00+", "000000.CC 80", "000002.CC", and
!     statement "VF,C", "DD(BU,1),C", "LV,1,C.C($1)" are 0 (octal /
!     numeric context); hex "CO", "BO", "FO", "7C" = 00, B0, F0, 70.
!   * YXCOMD: the label (line 30) prints "YXCCMD" with an open 4th glyph;
!     line 21's reference prints the O closed at 900 dpi.
!   * JCFIX: printed with an open C ("JCFIX"); C22-6728 (MCP Sys.
!     Analysis Guide) spells "JCFIX" ("location of which is JCFIX").
!   * JCNCS: C open in label and references; C22-6728 prints "JCNCS".
!   * "YXW CMD" = YXWCMD (D stem worn; landed p.269 line 38).
!   * line 53 "BAE,J ENDC" / line 55 label "J ENDC" = JENDC (D worn).
!   * $MCP, $RET (lines 36-37): printed with $ glyphs; binaries 000040 /
!     000041 = 32 / 33, the MCP pseudo-op system symbols.
!
! EXTERNALS.  Index registers JINXK=$1, JMKNT=$2, and JLINK, JLMSG are
! p.296's (scratch, not landed); their forms copy that deck.  The LVI
! byte .03 01 and KF byte 81 confirm JINXK=$1; LX .04 and CB+/SV .05
! confirm JMKNT=$2.
!
! THE PAGE ENDS IN A BARE SIC.  Line 56 SIC,S PRIM R's branch half is
! p.296 line 1 (BD,S PRIME at 232741.00).  The assembler refuses a SIC
! with nothing after it ("found 'end of program'"), so a scaffold
! "SLC, (8)232741.0" (p.296's origin, emits nothing) follows it, as
! decks/mcp_bootstrap_p255.strap does.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  QH000001 .. QH000051.  Lines 20-21 (the EXT pair) share
! QH000020; then lines 36-37 share QH000035, 38-39 QH000036, 40-41
! QH000037, 42-43 QH000038 (each a B and the half word after it on one
! card); line N prints QH0000(N-5) from line 44 on.  None skipped.

YXWCMD  SYN, (8)231160.0             ! b6 p.269 line 38 YXWCMD XW; LX line 30 231160.02, half word only
YMPFCH  SYN, (8)231141.0             ! b6 p.269 line 14 YMPFCH SC; B line 31 231141.10, half word only
SXCHAN  SYN, (8)215002.0             ! landed p.99 XW (body 215002.00); LX line 44 215002.02
SYCOCH  SYN, (8)215006.0             ! landed p.99 VF (body 215006.00); V+ lines 45-46 215006.02
SCNSSG  SYN(BU,1), 0.47              ! landed p.99 line 35; CM0000 line 48 000000.57
PMCPBF  SYN, (8)216775.0             ! landed p.137 line 22 DR(BU,64),(13); LVI line 49 PMCPBF+3.0 = 217000.03
JINXK   SYN,$1                       ! p.296 line 10 (scratch); LVI byte .03 01
JMKNT   SYN,$2                       ! p.296 line 11 (scratch); LX .04 line 50
JLMSG   SYN, (8)232745.0             ! p.296 line 9 XW (scratch); LX line 50 232745.04
JLINK   SYN, (8)232743.0             ! p.296 line 5 CF (scratch); SV line 55 232743.05
SPRIMR  SYN, (8)215571.0             ! landed p.118 line 49; SIC line 56 215571.00, BIT-EXACT

        SLC, (8)232714.40
! line  1  -*************************************************************
! line  2  -          ********** THE SYSTEM COMMAND PACKAGE ***********
! line  3  -*************************************************************
        SLC,$                                                ! line  4 * printed 232714.40 *
! line  5  -          *****COMMAND PACKAGE TENTACLE*****
        CNOP                                                 ! line  6
JTENT   DD(BU,4),5                                           ! line  7  -NUMBER OF PARAMETERS
        DD(BU,1),0                                           ! line  8  -USER BIT - .4
        DD(BU,1),0                                           ! line  9  -ENTRY MODE NOT SAME .5
        DD(BU,1),0                                           ! line 10  -ENTRY MODE NOT DISABLED .6
        DD(BU,1),0                                           ! line 11  -ENTRY MODE IS ENABLED
        DD(BU,1),0                                           ! line 12  -NOT USED .8
        DD(BU,1),0                                           ! line 13  -BUSY BIT - .9
        DD(BU,1),0                                           ! line 14  -NOT USED .10
        DD(BU,2),(2)10                                       ! line 15  -FORM EFFECTIVE,NO RESTORE-SOURCE
! line 16  -CODE .11
        DD(BU,2),(2)10                                       ! line 17  -FORM EFFECTIVE,NO RESTORE-LOCATION .13
        DD(BU,2),(2)11                                       ! line 18  -FORM EFFEC.,RESTORE-NUMBER .15
        DRZ(BU,2),(14)                                       ! line 19 * -14 VOID FIELDS .17 THRU .44
        EXT(0,18)                                            ! line 20
        B,YXCOMD                                             ! line 21
        VF,0                                                 ! line 22  -LAST TENTACLE TABLE USED
JRETA   VF,0                                                 ! line 23  -RETURN ADDRESS
        VF,0                                                 ! line 24  -FWA OF PSEUDO OP LINKAGE
        ,0                                                   ! line 25  -PSEUDO OP
JCODE   ,0                                                   ! line 26  -SOURCE CODE
JFRST   ,0                                                   ! line 27  -LOCATION OF 1ST CHAR OF FIELD
JSIZE   ,0                                                   ! line 28  -MESSAGE LENGTH
        ,0                                                   ! line 29  -CONTENTS OF ERROR SLOT
YXCOMD  LX,1,YXWCMD                                          ! line 30
        B,YMPFCH                                             ! line 31
! line 32  -
! line 33  -          *****OPERATOR CONSOLE FIXUP*****
! line 34  -
JCFIX   DRZ(N),(2)                                           ! line 35 *
        B,$MCP                                               ! line 36
        ,$RET                                                ! line 37
        B,JCNCS                                              ! line 38
        NOP,                                                 ! line 39
        B,JCNCS                                              ! line 40
        NOP                                                  ! line 41  -CHANNEL SIGNAL
        B,JCNCS+2.0                                          ! line 42
        NOP                                                  ! line 43
JCNCS   LX,1,SXCHAN                                          ! line 44
        V+,1,SYCOCH                                          ! line 45
        V+,1,SYCOCH                                          ! line 46
        LV,1,0.0($1)                                         ! line 47  -GET UNIT STATUS ADDRESS
        CM0000,SCNSSG($1)                                    ! line 48
        LVI,JINXK,PMCPBF+3.0                                 ! line 49
        LX,JMKNT,JLMSG                                       ! line 50
        LFI(BU,8),(2)11111110                                ! line 51  -END CHARACTER
JCLOK   KF(V+I)(BU,8),.8(JINXK)                              ! line 52
        BAE,JENDC                                            ! line 53
        CB+,JMKNT,JCLOK                                      ! line 54
JENDC   SV,JMKNT,JLINK                                       ! line 55 *
        SIC,SPRIMR                                           ! line 56
        SLC, (8)232741.0                     ! scaffold: p.296's origin; SIC's branch half is p.296's first card (see header)

!SYM JTENT  232715.00
!SYM JRETA  232716.40
!SYM JCODE  232720.00
!SYM JFRST  232720.40
!SYM JSIZE  232721.00
!SYM YXCOMD 232722.00
!SYM JCFIX  232723.00
!SYM JCNCS  232731.00
!SYM JCLOK  232736.00
!SYM JENDC  232740.00
